{"id":"vod_bf_8718","vodId":"8718","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"恶魔阿萨谢尔在召唤你","name_cn":"恶魔阿萨谢尔在召唤你","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-9/42782dbcc811fe52d759e64f9c4c7676.jpg"},"summary":"鬼畜属性的芥辺（浪川大辅 配音）表面上只是个普通侦探，实际却是召唤恶魔解决众多难题的恶魔侦探。作为助手的工读生佐隈玲子（佐藤利奈 配音）在芥辺的事务所工作2个月之后，芥辺终于向玲子展示了自己召唤恶魔的超能力。玲子也借此机会进入了恶魔的世界。芥辺通过召唤不同的恶魔来处理侦探事务所的委托，但他所召唤的恶魔基本上都是有着各种缺陷的笨蛋。有职能为淫奔的下级恶魔阿萨谢尔（小野坂昌也 配音），他的特技为性骚扰。有职能为暴露的恶魔贵族贝西卜931世（神谷浩史 配音），他的爱好是吃排泄物。还有职能为嫉妒的温蒂妮•惠（小林优 配音），她深深迷恋着主人芥辺，对玲子抱着莫名其妙的敌意，是个十足的抖M。事务所每日的委托应接不暇，但正如芥辺所说，借助恶魔的力量也终究不会变得幸福，本人或其亲近的人一定会遭到应得的报应。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 18:30:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaohuanni/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emoasaxieerzaizhaoh